WEBVTT

00:00:02.930 --> 00:00:04.150
Loveland TV Tower.

00:00:05.230 --> 00:00:09.710
The tallest structure in the city,
standing at its center.

00:00:09.710 --> 00:00:12.990
It's probably safe to assume that it's 
the source of the triggering waves.

00:00:16.230 --> 00:00:18.560
Lucien, are you...

00:00:19.880 --> 00:00:23.520
Are you... part of Black Swan?

00:00:27.050 --> 00:00:28.210
No, I'm not.

00:00:29.130 --> 00:00:31.340
If I said that, would you believe me?

00:00:34.680 --> 00:00:40.980
Lucien would never... do anything to hurt me!

00:00:51.110 --> 00:00:54.360
<i>It's there... The transmitter for 
the electromagnetic waves...</i>

00:00:54.740 --> 00:00:58.230
<i>If I can stop it, the berserk 
Evols should settle down.</i>

00:00:59.190 --> 00:01:03.240
<i>All the things I thought were coincidence 
were actually inevitable events.</i>

00:01:03.910 --> 00:01:06.540
<i>It must be what people call "fate."</i>

00:01:07.510 --> 00:01:08.380
<i>But...</i>

00:01:10.770 --> 00:01:14.850
<i>Who decided that fate can't be changed?</i>

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:28.230
"It takes all the running you can do, 
to keep in the same place."

00:01:19.800 --> 00:01:28.230
~The Red Queen Hypothesis~

00:01:29.620 --> 00:01:30.910
<i>"Queen."</i>

00:01:30.910 --> 00:01:32.690
<i>The one who possesses her genes</i>

00:01:32.690 --> 00:01:35.310
<i>can bless those who have 
special powers, Evolvers,</i>

00:01:35.310 --> 00:01:38.590
<i>with even greater power, 
clearing a path to the future.</i>

00:01:38.590 --> 00:01:40.760
<i>When the Queen truly awakens,</i>

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:43.990
<i>will the world achieve further evolution, or...</i>

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:03.950
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:03:04.050 --> 00:03:07.910
"Dawn of Farewell"

00:03:16.110 --> 00:03:17.380
<i>Black Swan.</i>

00:03:19.740 --> 00:03:21.220
<i>So I was right.</i>

00:03:21.220 --> 00:03:23.020
<i>It really is in this tower.</i>

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.350
<i>Of course security is tight.</i>

00:03:39.350 --> 00:03:41.090
<i>How can I get inside?</i>

00:03:45.920 --> 00:03:48.970
Don't worry, Potato Chip Princess. It's me.

00:03:48.970 --> 00:03:50.100
Kiro?

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:51.000
Hi!

00:03:51.810 --> 00:03:54.860
I've been looking into the 
Evols going berserk, too.

00:03:54.860 --> 00:03:55.670
What?

00:03:56.350 --> 00:04:00.680
And I determined that there were 
triggering signals originating here.

00:04:03.930 --> 00:04:06.250
That's a super hacker for you.

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:12.960
All right. After you, Potato Chip Princess.

00:04:12.960 --> 00:04:14.440
Thank you, Kiro.

00:04:14.440 --> 00:04:16.280
You're very welcome.

00:04:18.700 --> 00:04:22.670
I can't just write off these incidents as 
stuff that happens to other people.

00:04:22.670 --> 00:04:24.610
Making Evols go out of control...

00:04:25.330 --> 00:04:28.280
It's completely unforgivable.

00:04:30.370 --> 00:04:32.470
Are you okay, Kiro?

00:04:32.470 --> 00:04:34.710
The news said you were retiring as an idol.

00:04:35.790 --> 00:04:37.270
I had no choice.

00:04:38.050 --> 00:04:42.920
I can't put my fans in any more danger.

00:04:44.500 --> 00:04:48.130
Of course, right now, I'm keeping 
my Evol in check so I don't use it!

00:04:48.130 --> 00:04:49.430
Kiro...

00:04:49.820 --> 00:04:51.520
We <i>will</i> stop it.

00:04:52.880 --> 00:04:53.680
Yeah.

00:04:58.090 --> 00:04:59.740
Section C, confirm.

00:05:00.100 --> 00:05:01.820
Section C confirmed.

00:05:02.250 --> 00:05:04.490
Section D, monitor check.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:06.530
Monitor check clear.

00:05:07.010 --> 00:05:08.760
No anomalies?

00:05:08.760 --> 00:05:10.960
No, sir. Not at this time.

00:05:10.960 --> 00:05:12.220
There are no problems.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:14.350
Carry on.

00:05:14.350 --> 00:05:15.440
Yes, sir!

00:05:15.440 --> 00:05:18.310
Area B1, Block A, monitor check.

00:05:18.310 --> 00:05:20.150
Monitor check clear.

00:05:20.150 --> 00:05:23.180
Area B2, Block B, monitor check.

00:05:23.180 --> 00:05:24.990
Monitor check clear.

00:05:25.390 --> 00:05:28.690
Now we won't show up on their monitors.

00:05:28.690 --> 00:05:31.760
We'll be able to get to the transmitter 
without them noticing.

00:05:32.870 --> 00:05:34.540
You know where it is?

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:35.230
Of course!

00:05:36.190 --> 00:05:37.640
Look at this.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:41.400
The electromagnetic transmitter is 
at the top of the tower... right here.

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:42.980
There?

00:05:42.980 --> 00:05:46.200
First, we'll head for the 
elevator via this route.

00:05:46.730 --> 00:05:50.470
If we take this, it's a straight shot to
 just below the rooftop viewing platform.

00:05:51.090 --> 00:05:54.310
From there, if we take the 
outside stairs up to the roof,

00:05:54.310 --> 00:05:56.110
the transmitter should be right there.

00:05:56.110 --> 00:05:57.480
The top...

00:05:58.140 --> 00:05:59.460
Outside stairs...

00:06:00.950 --> 00:06:01.920
Okay.

00:06:07.240 --> 00:06:08.140
Let's go.

00:06:11.390 --> 00:06:13.600
Hurry! Hurry!

00:06:16.180 --> 00:06:17.090
You okay?

00:06:17.090 --> 00:06:18.330
Y-Yeah.

00:06:18.330 --> 00:06:19.930
Just a little nervous.

00:06:19.930 --> 00:06:21.390
Just a little?

00:06:21.390 --> 00:06:22.920
Just a little.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:30.020
Hey. Is anyone using the elevator?

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:31.660
Sir. I will check.

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.700
None of them are in use.

00:06:37.900 --> 00:06:39.420
Really?

00:06:40.550 --> 00:06:42.000
Just about time, I think...

00:06:43.550 --> 00:06:44.670
Kiro?

00:06:44.670 --> 00:06:45.930
Look behind you.

00:06:49.060 --> 00:06:52.060
Wow... It's beautiful.

00:06:54.170 --> 00:06:56.150
Is this your first time up here?

00:06:56.150 --> 00:06:58.980
Yeah. For some reason, 
it makes my heart race.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:02.910
But this isn't the time for that, is it?

00:07:02.910 --> 00:07:03.770
Sorry.

00:07:04.180 --> 00:07:06.730
In that case, let's come back sometime.

00:07:08.690 --> 00:07:12.150
There's a great café on the viewing deck here.

00:07:12.150 --> 00:07:16.480
Their pancakes are the best! 
They're just so sweet!

00:07:16.480 --> 00:07:20.620
And there's also a restaurant that 
serves delicious baked cheesecake!

00:07:20.620 --> 00:07:23.690
Oh, and we have to eat the cream 
puffs from that one place, too...

00:07:23.690 --> 00:07:25.790
Which one should we go to first?

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.300
You really do love your sweets, don't you?

00:07:28.300 --> 00:07:31.060
I'm telling you, you're gonna 
really, super love them, too!

00:07:31.060 --> 00:07:32.260
Look forward to it, okay?

00:07:34.890 --> 00:07:36.290
A-Are we there?

00:07:36.290 --> 00:07:39.210
No... They've noticed us.

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:40.390
<b>1st Viewing Platform</b>

00:07:43.250 --> 00:07:43.920
There they are!

00:07:43.920 --> 00:07:44.410
This way!

00:07:44.410 --> 00:07:45.110
Stop!

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:46.950
Freeze!

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:02.060
Come on out!

00:08:02.620 --> 00:08:04.670
Reinforcements will be here soon.

00:08:04.670 --> 00:08:07.520
Just give up, for your own good!

00:08:09.150 --> 00:08:09.960
It's too bright!

00:08:15.940 --> 00:08:17.390
What is this?

00:08:18.680 --> 00:08:19.600
It's blinding!

00:08:23.020 --> 00:08:24.140
Kiro!

00:08:24.140 --> 00:08:24.870
Hide!

00:08:24.870 --> 00:08:26.150
Wait...

00:08:26.610 --> 00:08:27.550
<i>That thing...</i>

00:08:27.550 --> 00:08:30.390
<i>The guards were wearing them 
around their necks, too.</i>

00:08:30.390 --> 00:08:31.320
Quickly!

00:08:41.000 --> 00:08:42.750
Begin battle!

00:08:43.130 --> 00:08:45.810
Welcome. Allow us to guide you.

00:08:45.810 --> 00:08:48.410
Welcome. Allow us to guide you.

00:08:47.310 --> 00:08:48.410
Get out of the way!

00:08:48.410 --> 00:08:49.420
Welcome—

00:08:51.510 --> 00:08:52.210
An Evol!

00:08:54.680 --> 00:08:57.390
Welcome. Welcome. Allow us to guide you.

00:09:00.050 --> 00:09:01.340
<i>Something isn't right...</i>

00:09:01.340 --> 00:09:03.230
<i>How can he use his Evol?</i>

00:09:03.510 --> 00:09:04.990
<i>We're inside the tower,</i>

00:09:04.990 --> 00:09:07.160
<i>but the waves should affect 
everyone in here, too.</i>

00:09:07.890 --> 00:09:09.060
What's wrong?

00:09:09.910 --> 00:09:12.350
That the end of your little tricks?

00:09:13.090 --> 00:09:14.400
<i>Could this mean...</i>

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:16.770
Now it's our turn!

00:09:15.840 --> 00:09:17.360
Wait, Potato Chip Princess!

00:09:17.360 --> 00:09:19.410
There's no point in hiding!

00:09:19.670 --> 00:09:20.600
Here!

00:09:20.600 --> 00:09:21.330
Huh?

00:09:21.330 --> 00:09:22.950
Find out what you can, quickly!

00:09:24.650 --> 00:09:25.660
Got it!

00:09:28.620 --> 00:09:29.740
This looks like...

00:09:29.740 --> 00:09:32.680
something to block the 
special electromagnetic waves.

00:09:32.680 --> 00:09:34.310
It's a type of jamming device.

00:09:34.310 --> 00:09:35.170
I thought so.

00:09:35.170 --> 00:09:37.460
Then if we break the devices—

00:09:37.460 --> 00:09:38.390
No.

00:09:38.390 --> 00:09:40.320
Instead of breaking each one,

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:42.430
it'd be faster to crush the source.

00:09:43.480 --> 00:09:46.790
There must be a main system 
controlling all the terminals.

00:09:46.790 --> 00:09:47.930
Is this it?

00:09:56.070 --> 00:09:59.160
My head... is splitting...

00:10:08.480 --> 00:10:13.460
Looks like both the guards and 
the reinforcement team are down.

00:10:13.460 --> 00:10:14.260
Yeah.

00:10:15.540 --> 00:10:16.760
Shall we go?

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:17.720
Let's.

00:10:20.220 --> 00:10:23.050
The entrance to the 
emergency stairs is just ahead.

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:23.680
Okay.

00:10:25.570 --> 00:10:26.390
An Evol?!

00:10:37.820 --> 00:10:38.620
Kiro!

00:10:38.620 --> 00:10:42.310
Sorry, but the path ahead 
has been closed to visitors.

00:10:42.310 --> 00:10:45.400
All uninvited guests will be asked to exit.

00:10:45.400 --> 00:10:46.120
What?

00:10:47.540 --> 00:10:49.040
Adieu.

00:10:54.890 --> 00:10:56.510
Kiro!

00:11:00.590 --> 00:11:03.970
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:11:05.600 --> 00:11:08.980
<b>Mr. Love: Queen's Choice</b>

00:11:12.200 --> 00:11:15.390
<i>I don't know my own birthday.</i>

00:11:16.250 --> 00:11:19.390
<i>By the time I became aware, 
I was already in that place.</i>

00:11:21.360 --> 00:11:24.780
<i>We weren't humans. We were mere objects.</i>

00:11:26.120 --> 00:11:28.550
<i>We were used in experiments 
we didn't understand...</i>

00:11:28.970 --> 00:11:32.120
<i>and when we couldn't take 
any more, we were discarded.</i>

00:11:50.670 --> 00:11:53.350
<i>That's where I met her.</i>

00:11:57.080 --> 00:11:58.770
Wh-Who are you?

00:12:00.820 --> 00:12:02.110
A little bear?

00:12:07.300 --> 00:12:08.030
Huh?

00:12:08.560 --> 00:12:10.330
You'll let me borrow him?

00:12:13.390 --> 00:12:14.710
How cute.

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:16.680
Thank you.

00:12:17.370 --> 00:12:19.630
Oh, right! Let me pay you back!

00:12:19.630 --> 00:12:23.180
I have some candy in my pocket...

00:12:23.940 --> 00:12:28.080
Oh... Since I changed clothes, 
I don't have it right now.

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.500
"Candy"?

00:12:29.500 --> 00:12:30.830
You don't know what that is?

00:12:30.830 --> 00:12:31.770
No.

00:12:32.070 --> 00:12:34.510
It's sweet and really delicious!

00:12:34.510 --> 00:12:37.230
Once I get back home, 
I'll give you some! I promise!

00:12:38.750 --> 00:12:39.780
Okay.

00:12:42.080 --> 00:12:43.720
<i>I made up my mind back then!</i>

00:12:47.940 --> 00:12:50.620
I will protect you, no matter what!

00:12:50.930 --> 00:12:51.960
Kiro...

00:12:54.050 --> 00:12:57.240
Getting older has made me 
more cautious, you see.

00:12:57.240 --> 00:12:59.540
To prepare for a worst case scenario,

00:13:00.070 --> 00:13:04.560
I made sure this guy was 
on a different control circuit.

00:13:04.560 --> 00:13:06.620
Now, if you'll just come with me...

00:13:07.490 --> 00:13:08.490
Whoa, there.

00:13:11.680 --> 00:13:15.020
Countless units of rebar 
were used in this tower.

00:13:15.280 --> 00:13:19.720
With my magnetism Evol, 
I can manipulate them at will.

00:13:19.720 --> 00:13:21.470
You understand, don't you?

00:13:21.470 --> 00:13:22.650
This is the end.

00:13:23.090 --> 00:13:24.310
Magnetism...

00:13:26.590 --> 00:13:27.490
Hello!

00:13:35.570 --> 00:13:37.460
Did you... enjoy yourself?

00:13:37.460 --> 00:13:41.980
We await... We await your next visit...

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:59.190
That's enough playing tag!

00:13:59.710 --> 00:14:04.150
Do as I say, or you're going 
to fall from here, too...

00:14:04.690 --> 00:14:05.990
Queen.

00:14:07.840 --> 00:14:09.140
<i>Stop it!</i>

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.700
<i>You shouldn't bully girls!</i>

00:14:10.700 --> 00:14:11.370
Kiro?

00:14:12.500 --> 00:14:15.180
<i>I won't let anyone who does that
have the Potato Chip Princess!</i>

00:14:16.190 --> 00:14:18.780
<i>Everything's all right now, 
Potato Chip Princess!</i>

00:14:18.780 --> 00:14:20.960
Kiro! Thank goodness!

00:14:21.350 --> 00:14:22.650
You're all right!

00:14:22.650 --> 00:14:25.800
<i>Of course! I am a superhero, you know!</i>

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:28.760
Honestly... Even at a time like this...

00:14:29.100 --> 00:14:30.400
Don't worry!

00:14:30.400 --> 00:14:34.010
I'll defeat the bad guys 
and get you out of there!

00:14:34.010 --> 00:14:35.420
Yes!

00:14:41.860 --> 00:14:46.570
Is playing little tricks while 
in hiding all you're capable of?

00:14:46.570 --> 00:14:50.030
You don't have the guts 
to show yourself, coward!

00:14:51.320 --> 00:14:52.490
There you are!

00:14:57.210 --> 00:14:58.710
You... You couldn't—

00:14:59.160 --> 00:15:01.420
Shall we take a dive together?

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:15.310
Kiro! Are you okay?

00:15:17.030 --> 00:15:17.770
Yeah!

00:15:19.360 --> 00:15:22.230
A superhero always wins!

00:15:22.500 --> 00:15:24.700
Man, I'm tired...

00:15:25.170 --> 00:15:28.110
That was ten times harder 
than filming an action movie.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:30.180
Thanks, Kiro.

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.140
Sure.

00:15:31.140 --> 00:15:32.150
Oh, right!

00:15:32.590 --> 00:15:34.700
I think I have in my pocket...

00:15:35.390 --> 00:15:37.620
magic candy that makes you feel better!

00:15:38.190 --> 00:15:39.000
Here!

00:15:41.890 --> 00:15:43.230
I promise!

00:15:46.290 --> 00:15:48.000
Is something wrong?

00:15:48.000 --> 00:15:50.450
Nope, nothing.

00:15:50.450 --> 00:15:51.780
Thank you.

00:15:51.780 --> 00:15:52.710
Sure.

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:53.900
And...

00:15:54.850 --> 00:15:56.890
You didn't forget what 
we talked about, right?

00:15:57.420 --> 00:16:01.250
When all of this is over, the two 
of us are going on a sweets tour!

00:16:01.250 --> 00:16:02.800
Are we?

00:16:02.800 --> 00:16:03.600
Yeah!

00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.220
All right.

00:16:05.220 --> 00:16:08.570
I suppose I have no choice but 
to keep this glutton company.

00:16:11.030 --> 00:16:12.220
What is that?

00:16:13.150 --> 00:16:14.350
This is bad.

00:16:15.030 --> 00:16:16.410
Is this...

00:16:16.410 --> 00:16:17.490
Let's go!

00:16:41.180 --> 00:16:43.080
Kiro! Are you okay?

00:16:43.080 --> 00:16:45.620
Yeah. I just slipped a little.

00:16:45.620 --> 00:16:46.730
Let's hurry!

00:16:53.320 --> 00:16:55.320
Kiro! What's wrong?

00:16:58.560 --> 00:16:59.820
I made up my mind...

00:17:00.810 --> 00:17:03.260
that I'd protect you, no matter what.

00:17:03.260 --> 00:17:03.960
Ki—

00:17:08.610 --> 00:17:10.770
This is my order to you.

00:17:11.600 --> 00:17:14.160
You will go out onto the rooftop 
and close the door.

00:17:14.770 --> 00:17:17.040
You will not allow anyone in.

00:17:17.040 --> 00:17:20.600
That includes me.

00:17:21.080 --> 00:17:21.940
Ki—

00:17:22.710 --> 00:17:23.560
What?

00:17:24.330 --> 00:17:26.390
Kiro... Don't do this...

00:17:27.190 --> 00:17:29.150
Please, Kiro!

00:17:42.760 --> 00:17:43.620
Kiro!

00:17:44.170 --> 00:17:46.250
I promise I will return one day.

00:17:46.860 --> 00:17:49.210
No! Don't do this, Kiro!

00:17:49.640 --> 00:17:53.640
So, Potato Chip Princess... wait for me.

00:17:55.260 --> 00:17:56.490
Kiro...

00:17:58.570 --> 00:17:59.730
Kiro!

00:17:59.730 --> 00:18:01.680
My hands... They won't move...

00:18:01.680 --> 00:18:03.040
Neither will my body!

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:06.360
Kiro! Are you okay?

00:18:09.270 --> 00:18:10.150
Wait—

00:18:13.100 --> 00:18:14.660
Why?

00:18:15.110 --> 00:18:18.340
Didn't you say we'd save everyone together?!

00:19:37.390 --> 00:19:40.270
<i>Now... everyone will be safe...</i>

00:19:41.150 --> 00:19:42.530
<i>I'm so glad.</i>

00:19:46.350 --> 00:19:48.370
A kid wouldn't let you 
have the potato chips.

00:19:48.370 --> 00:19:50.170
Be careful.

00:19:50.170 --> 00:19:52.830
There's no guarantee 
someone will always save you.

00:19:53.110 --> 00:19:55.080
Did you need something?

00:19:55.080 --> 00:19:59.090
You thought I'd end up in police custody
 rather than on the force?

00:20:09.170 --> 00:20:12.070
I'll be with you until the very end.

00:21:48.770 --> 00:21:50.360
Code P029.

00:21:50.360 --> 00:21:52.960
The Evol amplification device 
is confirmed to have stopped.

00:21:53.360 --> 00:21:54.760
That is not an issue.

00:21:55.170 --> 00:21:57.490
It has created a critical 
situation within the city

00:21:57.490 --> 00:22:00.590
and stimulated people's survival instincts.

00:21:57.870 --> 00:22:00.590
<b>Disasters in Loveland City</b>

00:21:57.870 --> 00:22:00.590
<b>Cause of continuing disturbances is unknown</b>

00:22:00.590 --> 00:22:02.990
It has more than accomplished its purpose.

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:07.960
There is no other way to fight a threat 
than to force one's own evolution.

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:12.950
Those who cannot withstand such 
change will simply fade away.

00:22:25.860 --> 00:22:28.360
Dream Vision System

00:22:31.060 --> 00:22:33.580
Hey! Wake up!

00:22:33.990 --> 00:22:37.740
Mom, it's morning! Food!

00:22:37.740 --> 00:22:39.400
I'm hungry!

00:22:39.400 --> 00:22:41.350
Come on, wake up!

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:43.360
Mom! Hey!

00:22:43.360 --> 00:22:46.460
I'm hungry! Come on!

00:22:50.030 --> 00:22:53.100
Yes. Our CEO is currently 
away on a business trip.

00:22:54.150 --> 00:22:55.370
Ah, yes!

00:22:55.370 --> 00:22:57.600
We're not sure when he'll return...

00:22:57.600 --> 00:23:00.120
Yes. I'm very sorry.

00:23:01.960 --> 00:23:04.980
Trust me, we want to know 
when he'll be back, too...

00:23:04.980 --> 00:23:05.980
Goldman!

00:23:06.890 --> 00:23:08.640
S-Sir?!

00:23:09.170 --> 00:23:13.830
Assemble all project managers in the 
meeting room in the next fifteen minutes.

00:23:15.380 --> 00:23:18.520
I have something I'd like them 
to start on immediately.

00:23:21.160 --> 00:23:23.800
<i>This is... my destiny?</i>

00:23:23.800 --> 00:23:25.500
<i>Even if the future is one we cannot deny,</i>

00:23:25.500 --> 00:23:28.420
<i>I will fight by your side to the very end.</i>

00:23:28.420 --> 00:23:29.630
<i>That is what I have decided.</i>

00:23:29.890 --> 00:23:31.630
<i>Episode eleven,</i>

00:23:31.620 --> 00:23:33.350
<i>"At the Edge of the Coming Time."</i>

00:23:31.630 --> 00:23:34.930
"At the Edge of the Coming Time"
